---

<Layout title="Eversales | Sales Accelerator and Architecture for Startups and SMEs.">
  
  <style is:global>
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
  </style>

  <style>
    /* 1. Entry Animations */
    @keyframes floatUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .animate-entry {
      animation: floatUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    .delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }

    /* 2. SPOTLIGHT EFFECT */
    .spotlight-item {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      --mouse-x: 50%;
      --mouse-y: 50%;
    }
    .spotlight-item::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: radial-gradient(400px circle at var(--mouse-x) var(--mouse-y), rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08), transparent 40%);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
    }
    .spotlight-item:hover::after {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* 3. INFINITE MARQUEE */
    @keyframes scroll {
      0% { transform: translateX(0); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } 
    }
    .animate-scroll {
      animation: scroll 80s linear infinite; 
      width: max-content; 
      will-change: transform; 
    }

    /* 4. TRACK CONTENT ANIMATIONS */
    .engine-track {
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .engine-track.hidden {
      display: none;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
    .engine-track.active {
      display: block;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .bubble-sme { background-color: #2563eb; } /* blue-600 */
    .bubble-startup { background-color: #f97316; } /* orange-500 */
  </style>

  <section class="relative pt-24 pb-20 md:pt-32 md:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1000px] h-[600px] bg-blue-400/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full -z-10"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="animate-entry inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 text-blue-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide mb-8">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 animate-pulse"></span>
        Accepting New Partners for Q1
      </div>

      <h1 class="animate-entry delay-1 text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-8 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        Your Sales Pipeline, <br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 to-blue-500">Augmented by AI.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="animate-entry delay-2 text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        We install a full pipeline with an integrated Neural Circuit that lowers your cost per lead and boosts conversion rates.
      </p>

      <div class="animate-entry delay-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto">
        <a href="#engine-section" class="px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white bg-slate-900 rounded-full hover:bg-blue-600 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/20 hover:scale-105 text-center">
          See How It Works
        </a>
        <a href="/events" class="spotlight-item px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all hover:border-blue-300 text-center">
          <span class="relative z-20">View Live Workshops</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

